{"type":"text","timestamp":1788417457384,"sessionID":"ses_f9a035716ffexc26ZwS76pGRvS","part":{"id":"prt_065fcbc02001DxiAaG3GmbHV50","messageID":"msg_065fcb5d9001RaioyFyhg08md7","sessionID":"ses_f9a035716ffexc26ZwS76pGRvS","type":"text","text":"\n\nI can see the issue. The `UUIDConvertor` in `convertors.py` currently only matches lowercase, hyphenated UUIDs. Let me update it to handle flexible UUID formats.\n\n","time":{"start":1788417457154,"end":1788417457379}}}
